:: Mine Punishment Creature Feature Rape Finish
<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	The <<person>> growls and runs into the darkness.
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	You push the creature off of you and scramble to your feet. You hear it rush back into the darkness.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<tearful>> you continue down the tunnel.
<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Creature Feature]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish
<<effects>><<unset $mine.creature>>

You approach the pedestal. You don't hesitate to dump out the bag. <span class="blue">Large chunks of meat fall out.</span> Before you can do anything, <span class="red">growls emanate from the tunnels around you.</span>
<br><br>
Not wanting to stay here, you run back the way you came. As you run, you hear horrible noises as things start to consume the meat.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 2]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 2
<<effects>>

You run through the winding tunnels. You take a second to regain your breath. As soon as you stop, <span class="red">you hear a loud growl from behind,</span> you look back to see a creature, larger than the rest.
<br><br>
You continue running down the tunnel before it can start running towards you. You hear it give chase, but you make it back to the elevator in time. The elevator starts up with a clunk. You slowly ascend, leaving large roars behind.
<br><br>
<<if ($worn.upper.name isnot "naked" or $worn.lower.name isnot "naked") and !$mine.setup.lantern>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish Lantern]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish Lantern
<<effects>>

You get the idea to hide the lantern they gave you in your outfit. It could come in handy later.

<br><br>
<<link [[Do it|Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3]]>><<set $phase to "take">><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Don't |Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3]]>><<set $phase to "leave">><</link>>



:: Mine Punishment Creature Feature Finish 3
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is "take">>
	<<set $mine.setup.lantern to 1>>
	You slip the lantern into your clothing. You hope they don't notice. <<stress 5>><<gstress>>
<<elseif $phase is "leave">>
	You decide it's too much of a risk.
<<else>>
	You sit down in wait.
<</if>>
<br><br>
The elevator eventually comes to a stop and you scramble out.
<br><br>
<<mine_punishment_end>>
